OL,3,GNEWSADouglas and Dublin mayors sign
OL,4,Afriendship agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a move to strengthen ties between
OL,7,Ftwo cities separated by the Irish Sea,
OL,8,Ftwo mayors have signed a Friendship and
OL,9,FCooperation Agreement.
OL,11,FThis week, a delegation from Dublin
OL,12,FCity Council led by Mayor Daryl Barron
OL,13,Fvisited the Isle of Man to "build
OL,14,Fstronger links" with the City of
OL,15,FDouglas.
OL,17,FHe and Douglas City Mayor Steven
OL,18,FCrellin signed the partnership in
OL,19,FEnglish, Manx and Irish Gaelic -
OL,20,Fsomething that has never done before.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
