OL,3,GNEWSADouglas and Dublin mayors sign
OL,4,Afriendship agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aim of the agreement is to ensure
OL,7,Fthat both cities can work together
OL,8,Fbuilding greater economic development
OL,9,Fand tourist links and ensure shared
OL,10,Fopportunities for young people.
